<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>SAE hyperparameters and training metrics</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Tables 1-3, we report the hyperparmeters used for training SAEs from scratch in this work. In Tables 4-5, we report evaluation metrics for SAEs that we train from scratch in this work.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Hyperparameters for OpenCLIP ViT-B/32 SAEs trained on residual stream activations of Gaussian noise inputs. Training time was approximately 35 mins on a single NVIDIA L40S GPU.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
