<span id="A5.T8.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A5.T8.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">• The article does not mention a completion date 
<br class="ltx_break">• The article does not claim that this is the first time such a comprehensive review has been conducted</span></span>
